# Autorig Tools product vision

Read `modulos/vision/how_it_works.md` before changing Maya or Unreal tools.
Do not invent a different product story.

When the user points at a file type or says "this information is here",
read `modulos/vision/mapa_datos.md` and put the data on the mapped menu
or path. Do not invent a new window. After wiring, fill the Sources
column there.

Short reminders:

- The repo exists so a rigger can autorig and maintain a character in Maya.
- Maya home is the AutoRig Tools menu and AutoRig shelf.
- Unreal is notes under `ue_tools/docs/` until scripts exist. Not a Maya menu.
- It is not a web app. Do not add Docker, FastAPI, or hub tiles.

Do not duplicate the full vision here. This rule points at the source doc.
